; MADRIGUERA - enemies, 8x16 sprite mode. Sprite tiles 46-75 (GDD 7.2, scene play): 8 of 30 used in M1.
; Each 16x16 frame = 4 tiles (left top, left bottom, right top, right bottom) -> F and F+2.
; BABOSA_A/B: slug facing RIGHT, 2 frames every 12 f (GACT_ANIM2), S_FLIPX for left.
; Hurt flash = OBP1 0xD8 (swaps light/dark gray: the dark body turns light).
; M2 appends TOPILLO (12), ESCUPIDOR (8), SEMILLA (2) after these 8 tiles.
; Generated by a scratch script; this file is the source of truth now.

